        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1376325555,
        "heading": "Cultivation",
        "text": "As mainly a tundra species, cloudberries grow in the wild, and are not cultivated on a commercial scale. In northern Alberta, agriculture, energy and industrial footprints reduce habitat suitability.",
